{{!-- One post as it looks when it is listed rather than read. The listing, the
      tag pages and the home page all render this, so a post looks the same
      everywhere and there is one place to change it.

      Both links are asked for by *identity*: `id` is the post's, carried on the
      card by `summaryCard`, and a tag page is named by the `slug=` sugar
      straight off the tag's own name. Neither line knows that this site is
      `extensionLess`, or that posts live under /blog/ — that is the engine's to
      know, and this partial's not to guess. --}}
<article class="card">
  <h3><a href="{{link id}}">{{title}}</a></h3>
  <p class="meta"><time datetime="{{date}}">{{dateLabel}}</time></p>
  <p>{{summary}}</p>
  <p>{{#each tags}}<a class="tag" href="{{link 'blog/tags' slug=this}}">{{this}}</a> {{/each}}</p>
</article>
